WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.445
Oh! Hello!

2
00:00:01.505 --> 00:00:02.365
[s@Oh! Hello!

3
00:00:03.146 --> 00:00:04.027
Who are you?

4
00:00:04.387 --> 00:00:06.088
I'm a grasshopper.

5
00:00:06.108 --> 00:00:11.733
We are insects that jump!

6
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.320
Where do you live?

7
00:00:32.401 --> 00:00:34.361
We live all over the world.

8
00:00:36.082 --> 00:00:37.962
We like forests and fields.

9
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:41.763
What do you eat?

10
00:00:43.384 --> 00:00:44.784
Grasshoppers eat plants.

11
00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.485
We eat lots of leaves.

12
00:00:50.746 --> 00:00:52.667
We like bark and flowers too.

13
00:00:54.447 --> 00:00:56.588
You have really long legs!

14
00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:00.318
Our long back legs help us jump.

15
00:01:01.659 --> 00:01:04.542
We can jump very high and very far.

16
00:01:06.944 --> 00:01:08.105
Can you fly?

17
00:01:10.126 --> 00:01:12.608
Most grasshoppers have wings and can fly.

18
00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:18.653
Our legs help us spring into the air.

19
00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:23.057
Do you have any enemies?

20
00:01:24.558 --> 00:01:26.220
Many animals like to eat us.

21
00:01:27.648 --> 00:01:29.370
But our colors help us hide.

22
00:01:30.571 --> 00:01:32.132
We can hop away fast too!

23
00:01:33.974 --> 00:01:35.255
Do you live alone?

24
00:01:36.757 --> 00:01:38.758
Grasshoppers usually live alone.

25
00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:42.082
But sometimes we gather in big groups.

26
00:01:44.844 --> 00:01:46.005
I see some fresh grass.

27
00:01:47.947 --> 00:01:49.168
I'm going to jump over there.

28
00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.771
Good-bye, Grasshopper!
